They're all, they love the
entertainment industry,

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.120
the film industry, that's cool.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.920
That's a sign of being so inspired by you.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:45.753
- I hope so.

00:00:45.753 --> 00:00:49.290
I hope, I mean Keely, their
mother is a great inspiration

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.570
and she keeps the whole boat afloat.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.170
Without her, we'd be rudderless.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.170
So, she has kept the feet
to the coals academically

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.480
and consequently they have
a really good education

